      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What would this Blender plugin do that something like CATS' doesn't already do? Because of the open-ended nature of VRChat's avatar system. Adding automation means removing creative freedom. See: Tafi, ReadyPlayerMe.\nVRChat already includes an in-game banner that links players to a YouTube tutorial series by Kung made for absolute beginners. And in less than 20 minutes, you get explained everything you need to know to upload an avatar. And VRChat themselves provide and manage an official Discord server with lots of dedicated channels to helping you make avatars and worlds.",
